Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Support A-GPS toggle

bind_nlp_setting_to_supl needs to be enabled in
/vendor/etc/agps_profiles_conf2.xml before this commit has any
effect. This works by providing a fake NLP setting status to mtk_agpsd,
which then uses it to en/disable A-GPS.
